Other
•        News;
•        Useful short codes;
•        FAQ and answers;
•        Connection issues.

Walk for Gigs is available on the TOP tariffs, allows to receive free internet for walking, 5000+ steps a day = 200MB. activ does not count steps but uses the data from the Health Kit app.

